    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/235d1b04b2904c72e7c088488c84ab38.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spencer, a former investigative journalist, lives in a small bunker with six other people who have also managed to stay alive after a viral outbreak brought the world to ruin. They're attempting to adjust to this new normal, until they stumble across some\u00a0notebook pages written by a scientist documenting the infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/72840b8cf59bb704773b2affba3ebfd4.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 20k Words, 60 - 90 minutes playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unlockable Achievements\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/b537867529421a73aa4ea706a5f86d7d.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epimutation contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing imagery/audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discussions of animal death and illness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depictions of panic attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashes\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player discretion is advised</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/235d1b04b2904c72e7c088488c84ab38.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spencer, a former investigative journalist, lives in a small bunker with six other people who have also managed to stay alive after a viral outbreak brought the world to ruin. They're attempting to adjust to this new normal, until they stumble across some\u00a0notebook pages written by a scientist documenting the infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/72840b8cf59bb704773b2affba3ebfd4.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 20k Words, 60 - 90 minutes playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unlockable Achievements\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441720/extras/b537867529421a73aa4ea706a5f86d7d.webp?t=1740445345\" width=250 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epimutation contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing imagery/audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discussions of animal death and illness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depictions of panic attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashes\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player discretion is advised</strong></p></li></ul>",
